---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor User
    actor Admin
    participant Pages as Browser pages<br/>/signup, /login,<br/>services/auth.ts
    participant MW as middleware.ts
    participant Routes as Route handlers<br/>/auth/confirm, /auth/callback
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>people
    participant AdminPage as Account Management<br/>utils/admin-actions.ts

    Note over User,AdminPage: Covers sign-up, sign-in and the approval gate. All steps exist on main as of October 11, 2026.<br/>Role and approval are in app_metadata (role, authenticated). Only the server can write app_metadata.

    alt Sign up with email and password
        User->>Pages: Enter email and password on /signup
        Pages->>Pages: signup(): the email has @, the password has 6 characters or more
        Pages->>Auth: supabase.auth.signUp(email, password,<br/>emailRedirectTo /auth/confirm)
        Auth->>DB: Trigger create_person_on_signup inserts a people row
        Auth-->>Pages: User. No role and no approval flag are set
        User->>Routes: Open the link in the confirmation email
        Routes->>Auth: GET /auth/confirm: exchangeCodeForSession(code)
        Routes-->>User: Redirect to /sites, or to /auth/auth-code-error
    else Sign in with Google or Microsoft (OAuth)
        User->>Pages: Select Google or Microsoft on /login or /signup
        Pages->>Auth: signInWithOAuth(provider, redirectTo /auth/callback)
        Auth-->>User: Provider sign-in, then redirect to /auth/callback?code
        User->>Routes: GET /auth/callback
        Routes->>Auth: exchangeCodeForSession(code)
        opt User made less than 10 s ago and has no app_metadata.authenticated
            Routes->>Auth: Service role: updateUserById, app_metadata<br/>{authenticated: false, role: existing or steward}
        end
        Routes-->>User: Redirect to next (same-site path only) or /sites
    else Sign in with email and password
        User->>Pages: Enter email and password on /login
        Pages->>Auth: signInWithPassword
        Auth-->>Pages: Session cookies
        Pages-->>User: Go to /sites
    end

    User->>MW: Any request
    MW->>Auth: getUser()
    alt No user
        MW-->>User: Redirect to /login (not for /login, /signup, /auth, /error)
    else app_metadata.authenticated is not true
        alt GET /sites
            MW-->>User: Page loads. ProtectedRoute shows "Awaiting Admin Approval" and a Sign Out button
        else Other GET page
            MW-->>User: Redirect to /sites
        else /api/* or a non-GET request (server action)
            MW-->>User: 403 'Your account is awaiting admin approval.'
        end
    else Approved
        MW-->>User: Request continues. The route or action checks the caller again
    end

    Note over Admin,AdminPage: Approval
    Admin->>AdminPage: Open /admin/account-management. getAllUsers()
    AdminPage->>AdminPage: isApprovedAdmin(): auth.getUser(), role admin and authenticated true
    AdminPage->>Auth: Service role: listUsers, 1000 users a page, until a page is not full
    Admin->>AdminPage: Approve the user, choose the role
    AdminPage->>Auth: updateUser(): service role updateUserById,<br/>app_metadata {...existing, role, authenticated: true}
    Auth-->>AdminPage: Saved
    Note over User,MW: The new app_metadata is in the session token after it refreshes.<br/>Then the middleware lets the user through.
